cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Upstream contributions: a record of issues and pull requests to upstream open-source projects"
message: "If you refer to this record, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Yuan"
    given-names: "Simin (Simon)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6843-3390"
    website: "https://github.com/simin-yuan"
abstract: >-
  A record of contributions to upstream open-source projects (Hermes Agent, SchemaStore,
  awesome-jsonschema, awesome-hermes-agent), kept with the original texts, timestamps, patches,
  raw API payloads and the output produced while the work was being done, so that the record
  does not depend on the platform that hosts it.
keywords:
  - open source
  - contribution record
  - software provenance
  - evidence
